5
00:00:06,986 --> 00:00:08,162
sweeps past like

6
00:00:08,162 --> 00:00:09,134
a lighthouse.

7
00:00:09,561 --> 00:00:10,843
Some spin hundreds

8
00:00:10,843 --> 00:00:11,703
of times a

9
00:00:11,703 --> 00:00:12,973
second, and keep

10
00:00:12,973 --> 00:00:14,044
time almost as

11
00:00:14,044 --> 00:00:14,904
well as an

12
00:00:14,904 --> 00:00:15,876
