13
00:00:16,303 --> 00:00:17,415
In 1972, NASA

14
00:00:17,415 --> 00:00:18,539
bolted a plaque

15
00:00:18,539 --> 00:00:19,609
to the Pioneer

16
00:00:19,609 --> 00:00:20,634
10 spacecraft.

17
00:00:21,061 --> 00:00:22,279
On it, fourteen

18
00:00:22,279 --> 00:00:23,455
lines point from

19
00:00:23,455 --> 00:00:24,315
the Sun to

20
00:00:24,315 --> 00:00:25,849
