29
00:00:34,985 --> 00:00:35,898
out when it

30
00:00:35,898 --> 00:00:36,870
was launched.

31
00:00:37,296 --> 00:00:38,873
No language needed.

32
00:00:38,873 --> 00:00:39,943
The stars give

